Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/sri-lanka-15-men-jailed-for-life-in-2019-easter-bombings/a-79382342--21e49f5e6a80.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/sri-lanka-15-men-jailed-for-life-in-2019-easter-bombings/a-79382342?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 15 convicts have been given prison sentences of at least 200 years each, following a long trial in what was among Sri Lanka's deadliest attacks.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nepal rejects 'sympathy,' asks for $20 mill after floods</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f6982eb2bffaf4ac57472156c879fb8afee172993ba510214deca7333d1b183</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T12:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nepal-rejects-sympathy-asks-for-20-mill-after-floods/a-79372239--b0482f9bc73a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nepal-rejects-sympathy-asks-for-20-mill-after-floods/a-79372239?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With Nepal still reeling from the devastating floods in August, Kathmandu is calling for climate justice and seeking compensation from the UN-backed Loss and Damage Fund, Environment Minister Geeta Chaudhary told DW.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Could we see MMA at the Olympics?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5d1b68e9624d96fc87bb1e1bab2e370c9709a450a134f1bbead5c5a298054bd4</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T12:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/could-we-see-mma-at-the-olympics/a-79369605--f76e8af14c92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/could-we-see-mma-at-the-olympics/a-79369605?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Mixed martial arts has made its debut at the Asian Games this week. It takes the sport closer to the Olympics but there are doubts about the next step, and the influence of the popular and lucrative UFC.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Male infertility is 'grossly underreported'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7c51e146751b26d206c50a6267770546903a7e5d2d6d5071afd12be82a716639</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722--14a06576edd4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">It's not all on women anymore — doctors do test men for sperm count and motility. But still too few men get checked, possibly due to a misconception that a healthy sex life means healthy sperm. Spoiler: It doesn't.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>As Trump-Xi summit nears, Europe is caught in middle of US-China rivalry</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:45939eb17182fd7b234e2e15a738489b03ddebb70d30484a29a62e9627e6afe2</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T18:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/as-trump-xi-summit-nears-europe-is-caught-in-middle-of-us-china-rivalry/a-79356540--3c6355b77845.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/as-trump-xi-summit-nears-europe-is-caught-in-middle-of-us-china-rivalry/a-79356540?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">China's Xi Jinping is traveling to Washington this week. Regardless of what comes from his talks with US President Trump, the EU will likely remain stuck between erratic US trade policy and Beijing's export machine.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Nuclear power is back on Southeast Asia's energy agenda</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e435a2c9c8038121bc3354d5bc1691d09cd538a7e2ed7a695bad0711ff5fae63</id><updated>2026-09-24T13:38:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T13:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nuclear-power-is-back-on-southeast-asia-s-energy-agenda/a-79358744--70fdccf67ff5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nuclear-power-is-back-on-southeast-asia-s-energy-agenda/a-79358744?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Rising electricity demand, shocks in energy security and climate commitments are reviving long-stalled plans for nuclear power across Southeast Asia. But proponents of nuclear energy still face major obstacles.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
